 multiple mining contribution models.

1. Core Miner
Core miners perform PoW mining for KeyBlocks generated approximately every 10 minutes.

2. Network Miner
Network miners perform PoW mining while also contributing available RPC capacity for transaction processing and network decentralization.

3. AI Miner
AI miners perform PoW mining while also serving AI inference workloads. Rewards are calculated based on the number of valid generated tokens.

4. ColossusX Full Miner
Colossus miners combine all contribution layers: PoW mining, AI inference, and RPC transaction processing. This mode is designed for high-performance 
machines with sufficient compute power and network bandwidth.
